            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwa neew’a mũndũ ũla wekĩĩte ngũa sya katane, ũla waĩ ĩũlũ wa manzĩ ma ũsĩ, yĩla wokĩlilye kw’oko kwake kwa aũme na kw’oko kwake kwa aka elekelye ĩtunĩ, na eevĩta kwa ũla wĩkalaa tene na tene kana kũkeethĩwa ĩvinda, na mavinda, na nyunzu ya ĩvinda; namo mamina kwananga ũtonyi wa ala andũ atheu, maũndũ aa onthe nĩmakeanĩw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
